-- What a proposition card shows besides its ementa.
--
-- Measured on 40 recent PLs, 21 ementas begin with "Altera" and 8 with "Dispoe": 72% open
-- with one of two words, and "Altera a Lei n. 10.826, de 22 de dezembro de 2003, para" spends
-- 55 characters before saying anything. The card had nothing else to tell two of them apart.
--
-- numero and ano come free in the listing and are the name people actually use for a
-- proposition. autorNome and autorTipo come from /autores, which already returns both: 190 of
-- 197 sampled propositions have exactly one author, and a third of the PLs are signed by an
-- orgao rather than a deputado, which the avatar row silently drew as nothing.
-- situacao, orgaoSigla and temas fill in later, as a proposition moves.
ALTER TABLE Proposicao ADD COLUMN numero INTEGER;
ALTER TABLE Proposicao ADD COLUMN ano INTEGER;
ALTER TABLE Proposicao ADD COLUMN autorNome TEXT;
ALTER TABLE Proposicao ADD COLUMN autorTipo TEXT;
ALTER TABLE Proposicao ADD COLUMN autoresTotal INTEGER;
ALTER TABLE Proposicao ADD COLUMN situacao TEXT;
ALTER TABLE Proposicao ADD COLUMN orgaoSigla TEXT;
ALTER TABLE Proposicao ADD COLUMN temas TEXT;
